      en: ["The church was officially established in 1688 as part of a hospital complex.", "It is famous for surviving the Great Fires of 1737 and 1756 with minimal damage.", "During the 19th century, it operated as a diocesan seminary for priests.", "The exterior walls feature indigenous coral stone typical of the period.", "A major restoration project was completed in 2004 to preserve its frescoes.", "The site remains one of the best examples of early colonial architecture in Panama."],
